<div style="font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #8C9194">04 · FROM POWDER TO PART</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 76px); line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -0.04em">Mineral powder in.<br>Engineered parts out.</h2>
